  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY:\nTransitive ({他動詞|たどうし})\n\nUSAGE:\n- 〜を{書|か}き{換|か}える (to rewrite/renew ~)\n\nFOR DOCUMENTS:\nWhen renewing official documents, {書|か}き{換|か}える is commonly used:\n- {免許|めんきょ}の{書|か}き{換|か}え (license renewal)\n- {登録|とうろく}の{書|か}き{換|か}え (registration renewal)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {書|か}き{直|なお}す (to rewrite - implies fixing/improving)\n- {更新|こうしん}する (to renew, update - more formal)\n- {置|お}き{換|か}える (to replace)",
